{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_28\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 28</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_28\">Problem 28</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 28\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fc70baf507102f4e2f1ff1716d503030cbb62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}=\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e61b7956bf48717618df32c13d7f4c2d195fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{r}{t}=\\frac{9}{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540d71d90eca2128e22a4eb38da837d7a61f429a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3mr-nt}{4nt-7mr}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/7/68710fec92c693054755eb76e87775418ff4ef13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -5\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{11}{14}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -1\\frac{1}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{11}{14}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"493\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fc70baf507102f4e2f1ff1716d503030cbb62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}=\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/8/9c8bfe4d09cfaac8b67945abdbca97bea8be8c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3m=4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e61b7956bf48717618df32c13d7f4c2d195fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{r}{t}=\\frac{9}{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/b/f2bd8940e9e219386723dd8bd10dd374e8c827a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14r=9t\\implies 7r=4.5t$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"187\" height=\"13\" />  \n</p><p>This simplifies the fraction to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be633c3dc0febf31c0a7f290222960209453b571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4nr-nt}{4nt-7r\\cdot m}\\implies \\frac{4nr-nt}{4nt-4.5mt}\\implies \\frac{4nr-nt}{4nt-1.5t\\cdot3m}\\implies \\frac{4nr-nt}{4nr-1.5\\cdot t\\cdot 4n}\\implies \\frac{\\frac{4\\cdot7r}{7}t-nt}{4nt-6nt}\\implies \\frac{\\frac{4\\cdot9t}{7\\cdot2}n-nt}{-2nt}\\implies \\frac{nt(\\frac{36}{14}-1)}{-2(nt)}\\implies\\frac{\\frac{22}{14}}{-2}\\implies \\boxed{\\frac{-11}{14} (\\textbf{B})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"1049\" height=\"94\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the ratio works for any set of integers satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fc70baf507102f4e2f1ff1716d503030cbb62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}=\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e61b7956bf48717618df32c13d7f4c2d195fc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{r}{t}=\\frac{9}{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />, it has to satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/500fb9788ed8553a319dd49cb6262faebcacc88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/7930e74d5266daad3b606d6afd464efe38a5590f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=9$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf0acfac3eaf4e599cc7ae449706b785b952a31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. From here it is just simple arithmetic.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/2/ef2781c270458f615391fa5505d4d6f30982c0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3mr-nt}{4nt-7mr}\\implies\\frac{3\\cdot4\\cdot9-3\\cdot14}{4\\cdot3\\cdot14-7\\cdot4\\cdot9}\\implies \\frac{3(36-14)}{4(42-63)}\\implies \\frac{3(22)}{4(-21)}\\implies \\boxed{\\frac{-11}{14} (\\textbf{B})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"648\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\